803	     * so {@code possibleDuplicate} is {@code false}. Otherwise it is a <em>possible</em> duplicate
804	     * when an existing owner shares its {@code lastName} (compared case-insensitively) and its
805	     * {@code postcode} but has a <em>different</em> normalized {@code telephone}:
806	     * {@code possibleDuplicate} is set {@code true} and {@code possibleDuplicateOf} to that owner's
